      en: ["About 25,000 inhabitants in Dhofar", "About 80 kilometers north of Salalah", "Caravan station on the frankincense route", "Wadi Dawkah a UNESCO World Heritage site since 2000", "Air base of the Royal Air Force", "Central role in the Dhofar Rebellion 1965-1976", "Gateway to the Rub' al Khali desert", "The desert covers about 650,000 square kilometers"],
