      en: ["About 25,000 inhabitants on the Omani side", "City divided between Oman and two emirates", "The Battle of Dibba in 633", "Victory during the Ridda Wars under Ikrima", "Musandam fjord landscape with cliffs up to 2,000 meters", "Boat trips on traditional dhows", "Coral reefs and uninhabited bays", "Dibba Al-Hisn belongs to Sharjah"],
